+      "kind": "analogous_to",
+      "rationale": "New end: \"Numerical evidence only: for twelve seeded real symmetric S3-equivariant kernel pairs with spectra in [0.1,0.9], the optimal expected\"; existing end: \"For Gamma-equivariant positive contractions Q, Q' the bound d-bar(P_Q, P_{Q'}) <= 6 3^{2/3} ||Q - Q'||_1^{1/3} holds, and\". This result addresses or audits C0039; the cited card identifies its mathematical context and is not used as a proof or a current openness certificate."
+    },
