+      "kind": "specializes",
+      "rationale": "New end: \"Let D be a bounded triangle invariant under reflection R across an axis, and let lambda_1 be the\"; existing end: \"In any acute triangle, can reflected Brownian motions from distinct starting points be coupled so their meeting-time tail\". This result addresses or audits P0023; the cited card identifies its mathematical context and is not used as a proof or a current openness certificate."
